Aerie-Purpose: Load Aerie's test-only browser and interactive UI test binaries (chrome/test/aerie) into the GN graph, so `./aerie test-cpp` can build them.
Aerie-Upstream-Area: BUILD.gn (gn_all)
Aerie-Kind: hook

Issue #175. GN only loads a build file that another target refers to, so the new
//chrome/test/aerie:tests group needs one reference. It sits in gn_all next to
//chrome/test:browser_tests. The group is testonly and is not part of the shipped
browser; `./aerie build` builds `chrome` and `chromedriver` only.

--- a/BUILD.gn
+++ b/BUILD.gn
@@ -153,6 +153,7 @@
           "//chrome/browser/ui/actions:dump_actions",
           "//chrome/browser/ui/color:dump_colors",
           "//chrome/test:browser_tests",
+          "//chrome/test/aerie:tests",
         ]
         if (!is_chromeos_device) {
           deps += [
